    "detailed_description": "<strong>Out of Time</strong> is a singleplayer escape the room 3D-quest set in steampunk universe.<br><br>Your main goal is to escape a secret research facility located out in the sea. This requires defusing the bomb before the time runs out. Involuntarily participating in a deadly race against time, you have to solve all the puzzles and uncover the truth about the mysterious facility.<br><br><strong>Key features:</strong><br>- Intense story about a girl trapped in a deadly time loop,<br>- weird research facility hidden away from curious eyes,<br>- neat visuals, unusual puzzles, mysteries and a quirky robo-bartender.<br><br><strong>Release date:</strong> December 2019",
